				<business-objective-ref Ref="0E946F0D85A5474AB07FE701864D9108" ID="45D7DC0895F04E3FB22CD56BA91A3F84" OriginalMap="Automotive - Sales &amp; Service Organizations: Improve inventory visibility" OriginalMapID="4737C4AEFF9E794E8ADFC17DF0FB88F8" SrcID="B16CEA254216460FBAF7B4B51E0967BA">
					<title>Improve inventory visibility</title>
				</business-objective-ref>
				<kpi-ref Ref="kpi-0OPPLAN003" ID="44A0A9CE6C4E4408826ED417078CB1FE" OriginalMap="Automotive - Sales &amp; Service Organizations: Delivery Performance to Customer Request Date" OriginalMapID="4737C4AEFF9E794E8ADFC17DF0FB88F8" SrcID="9D9876FE90BC4DF8A887B0DD12C2986A">
					<title>Delivery Performance to Customer Request Date</title>
				</kpi-ref>
				<short-description>
       This scenario supports modern locate-to-order processes for new
vehicles that have already been made and exist as finished goods
along the distribution chain. With its holistic approach to mange
the entire distribution chain from OEM to importer and down to the
dealership it perfectly meets the challenges of the industry today.
Hence it increases visibility, reduces cost, and creates a unique
buying experience for end-customers. A powerful vehicle search
capability allows to allocate the vehicles which meets the
customers' demand closest. The scenario is centralized around the
customer and the vehicle and supports vehicle configuration,
vehicle search, vehicle order management and vehicle distribution
including seamless vehicle tracking.
       <br xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"></br>
					<br xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"></br>
       The scenario is often applied in combination with the
build-to-order scenario. 
      </short-description>
				<hyperlink ID="CBCFD8EA04A44352AF7A831E100A80E1" href="https://websmp230.sap-ag.de/sap(bD1kZSZjPTAwMSZkPW1pbg==)/support/scl/default.htm?showheader=X&amp;startpage=-&amp;pstype=2&amp;psobj=01200615329100004026" OriginalMap="Automotive - Sales &amp; Service Organizations: Scenario and Process Component List" OriginalMapID="4737C4AEFF9E794E8ADFC17DF0FB88F8" SrcID="0FD820A44CF2420682824E86B9A5198A">
					<title>Scenario and Process Component List</title>
				</hyperlink>
			</business-scenario>
